# Root build-context ignore (spec 16, Gate-1). The build context is the repo ROOT, so this file
# is ALWAYS honored regardless of which Dockerfile is built — guaranteeing a developer's local
# `.env` can NEVER enter even an intermediate build layer (the per-Dockerfile
# apps/api/Dockerfile.dockerignore adds further, narrower exclusions).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
